.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK LINK ADD"
.SH NAME
hamstik work link add \- Link this work item to another
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work link add [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Link this work item to another
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --target-key
Target work item key (e.g. HAM-43)
.TP
.B --target-id
Target work item id (UUID)
.TP
.B --relation
Relation kind
Choices: blocks, blocked_by, relates
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
